{"id": "MINIGAME/JT06ORIH.SBN#0001", "file": "MINIGAME/JT06ORIH.SBN", "offset": 4053, "capacity": 4, "raw_hex": "25743130", "baseline_text": "%t10", "kind": "ascr", "source": "%t10", "pointer_offset": 3824, "unit": "dialogue:a00cbea9173d423c", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT06ORIH.SBN#0002", "file": "MINIGAME/JT06ORIH.SBN", "offset": 4058, "capacity": 18, "raw_hex": "f0f7f0b5f957f243f246f0b1f0ef81608148", "baseline_text": "각오는 되셨나요～？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "覚悟はよろしいですかぁ～？", "pointer_offset": 3828, "unit": "dialogue:2d3a420f5ec55ce6", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT06ORIH.SBN#0003", "file": "MINIGAME/JT06ORIH.SBN", "offset": 5177, "capacity": 48, "raw_hex": "f8b2f0bcf0d7f0b9f147f15781432f2ff8dff64cf1442f2ff1acf25af8aaf64cf944f243f95af154f15a8160f0ef8144", "baseline_text": "이 시합에서는，//제 패가//보너스 패가 되어 있어～요．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "この試合では、//わたしのパイが//ボーナスパイになってるで～す。", "pointer_offset": 3832, "unit": "dialogue:54ed0f09c2fb6526", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT06ORIH.SBN#0004", "file": "MINIGAME/JT06ORIH.SBN", "offset": 4148, "capacity": 64, "raw_hex": "f0b2fa48f1e2f0dff957f0b2f299f149f0b8f0cf816081442f2ff8b2f140f0b9f1478143f15af8bdf9a9f1d5f0d2f0e72f2ff1e1fbc1f1e2f1d58160f0ef81b8", "baseline_text": "이번 주제는 이것입니다～．//이 중에서，어느 한 세트를//맞춰 주세～요∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "今回のお題はこちらで～す。//この中の、どれか１組を//そろえてくださ～い！", "pointer_offset": 3836, "unit": "dialogue:27a2e01963995de4", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT06ORIH.SBN#0005", "file": "MINIGAME/JT06ORIH.SBN", "offset": 4221, "capacity": 26, "raw_hex": "f0dff14481432f2ff5f3f0c7f8e7f362f0c8f0f1f0ef816081b8", "baseline_text": "제가，//딜러를 맡을게요～∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "わたしが、//親をやりま～す！", "pointer_offset": 3840, "unit": "dialogue:3aaf09998348cb05", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT06ORIH.SBN#0006", "file": "MINIGAME/JT06ORIH.SBN", "offset": 4250, "capacity": 40, "raw_hex": "f0b2f248f0b9f1578143f140f279f27af0b22f2ff5f3f0c7f8e7f0a5f346f8f4f1cff0aff0ef8144", "baseline_text": "이번에는，중위님이//딜러를 하셔도 좋아요．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "今度は、中尉さんが//親をやっていいですよ。", "pointer_offset": 3844, "unit": "dialogue:178e3c3677f04b2a", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT06ORIH.SBN#0007", "file": "MINIGAME/JT06ORIH.SBN", "offset": 4293, "capacity": 30, "raw_hex": "f455f2ce8160f3a881442f2ff178f8f3fbccf35af14ff26b8160f0ef8144", "baseline_text": "훗후～응．//식은 죽 먹기예～요．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ふっふ～ん。//ちょろいもんで～す。", "pointer_offset": 3848, "unit": "dialogue:a29368608000790d", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT06ORIH.SBN#0008", "file": "MINIGAME/JT06ORIH.SBN", "offset": 4328, "capacity": 46, "raw_hex": "f0b28143f0b2f28af7d12f2ff2def944f280f281f9fbf1c8f26bf0ef81b82f2ff2b0f8c8f94af1b5f15af0ef81b8", "baseline_text": "이，이건…//뭔가 잘못된 거예요∈//믿을 수 없어요∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "こ、これは……//何かのまちがいでーす∈//信じられませーん！", "pointer_offset": 3852, "unit": "dialogue:b63baa9c24612d83", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT06ORIH.SBN#0009", "file": "MINIGAME/JT06ORIH.SBN", "offset": 4387, "capacity": 50, "raw_hex": "f0f081608143f1c3f1c8f3d2f15a8160f0ef81442f2ff9a9fa48fab8f6f4f0b5f0a5f8a4f287f0a2f24df143f0ef81608148", "baseline_text": "네～，즐거웠어～요．//한 번 더 듀오하지 않으실래요～？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "は～い、楽しかったでーす。//もう１回デュオしませんか～？", "pointer_offset": 3856, "unit": "dialogue:7c628ac2ebce7536", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT06ORIH.SBN#0010", "file": "MINIGAME/JT06ORIH.SBN", "offset": 4444, "capacity": 50, "raw_hex": "f0cff2c3f0f381432f2ff0adf0aef8aff247f26b8160f0ef81442f2ff0b2f0dff293f0ddf944f151f3f8f26b8160f0ef81b8", "baseline_text": "다음은，//마리아 씨예～요．//이제부터가 진짜예～요∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "お次は、//マリアさんで～す。//これからが本番ですよ～！", "pointer_offset": 3860, "unit": "dialogue:b8f843a45773bac9", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT06ORIH.SBN#0011", "file": "MINIGAME/JT06ORIH.SBN", "offset": 4499, "capacity": 18, "raw_hex": "f2b5f25af2a9f0d2f944f3a1f259f8c8f16e", "baseline_text": "토너먼트가 끝났을 때", "kind": "ascr", "source": "勝ち抜き戦が終わった時", "pointer_offset": 3864, "unit": "dialogue:bb0e5833a13689be", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT06ORIH.SBN#0012", "file": "MINIGAME/JT06ORIH.SBN", "offset": 4522, "capacity": 14, "raw_hex": "f491f0a5f186f469f0b8f0cf8144", "baseline_text": "축하드립니다．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "おめでとうございます。", "pointer_offset": 3868, "unit": "dialogue:b84710c5e1d20d4f", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT06ORIH.SBN#0013", "file": "MINIGAME/JT06ORIH.SBN", "offset": 4545, "capacity": 54, "raw_hex": "f9a9fa48fab8f0e2f2abf94bf186f1b2f0f42f2ff1cff0cef0b8f0cff1d4f7d12f2ff15af256f8f1f0a5f0bcf29ef15af0ef81608148", "baseline_text": "한 번 더 대결해 드려도//좋습니다만…//어떻게 하시겠어요～？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "もう一度対戦してあげても//いいですけど……//どうしますか～？", "pointer_offset": 3872, "unit": "dialogue:943e327e5d68c6dc", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT06ORIH.SBN#0014", "file": "MINIGAME/JT06ORIH.SBN", "offset": 4606, "capacity": 34, "raw_hex": "f2cef455f7d12f2ff0d8f143f1482f2ff1ccf8e3f153f0faf195f0f0f0ef816081b8", "baseline_text": "후훗…//그래야//일본 남자답네요～∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ふふ……//それでこそ、//日本男児で～す∈", "pointer_offset": 3876, "unit": "dialogue:ddf09acf4f6af912", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT06ORIH.SBN#0015", "file": "MINIGAME/JT06ORIH.SBN", "offset": 4647, "capacity": 64, "raw_hex": "f0b981608143f0d8f1d4f0f9f0bcf957f28af144f0ef81482f2ff36cf36cf0a5f0f0f0ef816081442f2ff0cff2c3f8b9fbf4f0e2f2abf94bf1e2f1d5f0ef8144", "baseline_text": "에～，그만두시는 건가요？//심심하네요～．//다음에 또 대결해 주세요．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "え～、やめちゃうんですか？//つまんないですね～。//また今度、対戦してくださいね。", "pointer_offset": 3880, "unit": "dialogue:ac0680528b0d2413", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT06ORIH.SBN#0016", "file": "MINIGAME/JT06ORIH.SBN", "offset": 4728, "capacity": 30, "raw_hex": "f455f2ce8160f3a881442f2ff178f8f3fbccf35af14ff26b8160f0ef8144", "baseline_text": "훗후～응．//식은 죽 먹기예～요．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ふっふ～ん。//ちょろいもんで～す。", "pointer_offset": 3884, "unit": "dialogue:a29368608000790d", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT06ORIH.SBN#0017", "file": "MINIGAME/JT06ORIH.SBN", "offset": 4763, "capacity": 46, "raw_hex": "f0b28143f0b2f28af7d12f2ff2def944f280f281f9fbf1c8f26bf0ef81b82f2ff2b0f8c8f94af1b5f15af0ef81b8", "baseline_text": "이，이건…//뭔가 잘못된 거예요∈//믿을 수 없어요∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "こ、これは……//何かのまちがいでーす∈//信じられませーん！", "pointer_offset": 3888, "unit": "dialogue:b63baa9c24612d83", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT06ORIH.SBN#0018", "file": "MINIGAME/JT06ORIH.SBN", "offset": 4822, "capacity": 50, "raw_hex": "f0f081608143f1c3f1c8f3d2f15a8160f0ef81442f2ff9a9fa48fab8f6f4f0b5f0a5f8a4f287f0a2f24df143f0ef81608148", "baseline_text": "네～，즐거웠어～요．//한 번 더 듀오하지 않으실래요～？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "は～い、楽しかったでーす。//もう１回デュオしませんか～？", "pointer_offset": 3892, "unit": "dialogue:7c628ac2ebce7536", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
